ya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんにも今日言ったけど19にはみえないじょっ？o(^▽^)o笑\nでも本当におめでとう*\\(^o^)/*\nいつもまあやまあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれていつもはなんだよぉ～っ( ^ω^ )っていってるけど本当はうれしんだぁっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも色々大変だろうけどみんなで一緒に頑張ろうねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんにとって素敵な１年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0029.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も卒業しちゃったメンバーとのお別れもあって寂しい事もあったけど‥\n沢山の方と出会えた事や沢山の言葉をもらって\n1年間走る事が出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさん、そして皆に\n育ててもらってるって感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の期待に応えられるような人になりたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはまだまだ足りない事が沢山あるし、気が付かない事も沢山あると思う\nでも少しづつかもしれないけど、成長したい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙が出そうな時や くじけそうな時は聞いてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも支えて下さい。\nまあやには皆さんが必要っす(>_<)\nI need you（＾ν＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が健康で笑顔で過ごせますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ明日は国際フォーラムで感謝祭だっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"国際ハーレムって今まで勘違いしてたのはここだけのシークレット話やでっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0036.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/12/29/6092849/0037.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}